    {
      "subId": "4121309",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the Fatui who have come to take the sword",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4121310",
      "subQuestName": "Speak to Albedo",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "412130501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "412130501": {
            "id": "412130501",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I heard the ruckus and came over to check. So it was you who made all this noise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130502"
            ]
          },
          "412130502": {
            "id": "412130502",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "What happened? Did you get into a fight?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130503"
            ]
          },
          "412130503": {
            "id": "412130503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "M—Mr. Albedo... I—I didn't mean to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130504"
            ]
          },
          "412130504": {
            "id": "412130504",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Aren't you supposed to be organizing documents? Why did you come here all of a sudden?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130505"
            ]
          },
          "412130505": {
            "id": "412130505",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "And you got into a fight with such a dangerous opponent — in this terrain...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130506"
            ]
          },
          "412130506": {
            "id": "412130506",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I—I also got into a fight, I'm sorry...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130507"
            ]
          },
          "412130507": {
            "id": "412130507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well now even Paimon feels guilty...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130508"
            ]
          },
          "412130508": {
            "id": "412130508",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "Uh... Ah... I only... I'm sorry, I was just passing by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130509"
            ]
          },
          "412130509": {
            "id": "412130509",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Huh, I reckon you've been led astray by yet another thing that attracted your attention.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130510"
            ]
          },
          "412130510": {
            "id": "412130510",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I told Sucrose about the sword, my bad.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130511"
            ]
          },
          "412130511": {
            "id": "412130511",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "You told her everything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130512"
            ]
          },
          "412130512": {
            "id": "412130512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We just told her about the sword's properties and origin. We didn't let her touch it! We know better than that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130513"
            ]
          },
          "412130513": {
            "id": "412130513",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "*sigh* Never mind. We couldn't have kept her in the dark for too long anyway.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130514"
            ]
          },
          "412130514": {
            "id": "412130514",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Sucrose is naturally drawn to obscure knowledge and mystery. She is great alchemist material, indeed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130515"
            ]
          },
          "412130515": {
            "id": "412130515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "Ah... Uh... I promise I won't be causing trouble anymore. I swear on the quadruple-size Sweet Flower seeds I just propagated!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130516"
            ]
          },
          "412130516": {
            "id": "412130516",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "It's not trouble that worries me, I'm only concerned with your safety. You must be more careful next time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130517"
            ]
          },
          "412130517": {
            "id": "412130517",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "*sigh* Anyway, what's going on with that adventurer crouching over there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130518"
            ]
          },
          "412130518": {
            "id": "412130518",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "I took it upon myself to protect Mr. Pallad during the battle. He should be alright.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130519"
            ]
          },
          "412130519": {
            "id": "412130519",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Reckless Pallad",
            "text": "I'm... I'm freezing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130520"
            ]
          },
          "412130520": {
            "id": "412130520",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "He must've caught a cold during the fight.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130521"
            ]
          },
          "412130521": {
            "id": "412130521",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "Ahhhh, I didn't consider that possibility... It's my oversight, my apologies!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130522"
            ]
          },
          "412130522": {
            "id": "412130522",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Sucrose",
            "text": "Mr. Albedo, I'll check on him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130523"
            ]
          },
          "412130523": {
            "id": "412130523",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Sure.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130524"
            ]
          },
          "412130524": {
            "id": "412130524",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sucrose may seem a bit rigid, but she's a good kid with a heart of gold.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130525"
            ]
          },
          "412130525": {
            "id": "412130525",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I wouldn't call her a kid if I were your size.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130526"
            ]
          },
          "412130526": {
            "id": "412130526",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Can't disagree.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130527"
            ]
          },
          "412130527": {
            "id": "412130527",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "That girl... Let her out of your sight, and she winds up in the strangest places...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130528"
            ]
          },
          "412130528": {
            "id": "412130528",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Isn't that just what young people do in general?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130529"
            ]
          },
          "412130529": {
            "id": "412130529",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "True.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130530"
            ]
          },
          "412130530": {
            "id": "412130530",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sucrose didn't mean to cause trouble. Don't be too hard on her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130531"
            ]
          },
          "412130531": {
            "id": "412130531",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Don't worry, I'm not angry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130532"
            ]
          },
          "412130532": {
            "id": "412130532",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? There seems to be a shiny thingy on the sword.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130533"
            ]
          },
          "412130533": {
            "id": "412130533",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Huh? Another change...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130534"
            ]
          },
          "412130534": {
            "id": "412130534",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "The sword's power is much stronger than before. How did that happen?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130535"
            ]
          },
          "412130535": {
            "id": "412130535",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We fought with Fatui.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130536"
            ]
          },
          "412130536": {
            "id": "412130536",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "There were some ferocious characters among those Fatui soldiers. We've never seen them before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130537"
            ]
          },
          "412130537": {
            "id": "412130537",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "So it's the energy it's never encountered before...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "412130538"
            ]
          },
          "412130538": {
            "id": "412130538",
            "speakerId": 1006,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "It caused the sword to greatly grow in strength."
          }
        }
      }
    },
